OL,3,AIsrael's president tasks opposition
OL,4,Aleader Eisenkot with forming government
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Now is the time to form a national
OL,7,Femergency government. I will do
OL,8,Feverything to ensure we are worthy,"
OL,9,Fthe former military chief wrote on X.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
